<title>ROMANIA: SOCCER-DINAMO BUCHAREST SACK TRAINER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DINAMO BUCHAREST SACK TRAINER.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Top Romanian soccer club Dinamo Bucharest on Tuesday sacked trainer Marian Bondrea after only six months in office, blaming him for bad results.</p>
<p>&quot;Dinamo have played badly in the last five or six matches at home and the games they won were won with God's help,&quot; Dinamo president Petre Buduru said.</p>
<p>On Sunday, Dinamo lost 3-0 against big rivals Rapid Bucharest. Dinamo are currently fourth in the league.</p>
